OL,3,GNEWSAFamily's 150 years of farming to
OL,4,Aend as site shuts
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe site was bought by Wokingham
OL,7,FBorough Council for #2.8m in 2014 and
OL,8,Fthe farm will close on Saturday, ahead
OL,9,Fof a major sports hub opening in 2030.
